{
  "version": "2025.10",
  "description": "Toggle contract — persistent on/off controls.\n\nCovers standalone Toggle. ToggleGroup is always a joined segmented bar and\nreads the segment contract for cell chrome; it does not use a layout variant.\n\nColour hooks resolve at recipe use-sites:\n  --a63-toggle-background           -> transparent\n  --a63-toggle-foreground           -> var(--a63-text-primary)\n  --a63-toggle-hover-background     -> var(--a63-surface-control-hover)\n  --a63-toggle-primary-background   -> var(--a63-action-primary)\n  --a63-toggle-primary-foreground   -> var(--a63-action-primary-foreground)\n\nThe pressed neutral fill is a token, so a theme whose neutral solid sits\nclose to its page (terminal) can give a pressed toggle its own fill. Each\nmode block repeats it so a nested light or dark scope resolves it against\nits own action roles.",
  "sets": {
    "base": {
      "sources": [
        {
          "a63": {
            "toggle": {
              "border": {
                "width": {
                  "$type": "dimension",
                  "$value": "{a63.segment.border.width}"
                }
              },
              "gap": {
                "$type": "dimension",
                "$value": "{a63.control.gap}"
              },
              "group": {
                "gap": {
                  "$type": "dimension",
                  "$value": "{a63.segment.gap}"
                }
              },
              "radius": {
                "$type": "dimension",
                "$value": "{a63.control.radius}"
              },
              "shadow": {
                "$root": {
                  "$type": "shadow",
                  "$value": []
                },
                "active": {
                  "$type": "shadow",
                  "$value": []
                }
              },
              "text": {
                "shadow": {
                  "$type": "shadow",
                  "$value": []
                }
              },
              "disabled": {
                "opacity": {
                  "$type": "number",
                  "$value": 0.56
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "$extensions": {
        "io.atom63.css": {
          "selector": ":root"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "modifiers": {
    "mode": {
      "default": "light",
      "contexts": {
        "light": [
          {
            "a63": {
              "toggle": {
                "on": {
                  "background": {
                    "$type": "color",
                    "$value": "{a63.action.neutral}"
                  },
                  "foreground": {
                    "$type": "color",
                    "$value": "{a63.action.neutral.foreground}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "dark": [
          {
            "a63": {
              "toggle": {
                "on": {
                  "background": {
                    "$type": "color",
                    "$value": "{a63.action.neutral}"
                  },
                  "foreground": {
                    "$type": "color",
                    "$value": "{a63.action.neutral.foreground}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "resolutionOrder": [
    {
      "$ref": "#/sets/base"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "#/modifiers/mode"
    }
  ],
  "$extensions": {
    "io.atom63.css": {
      "attribute": "data-a63-mode",
      "selectors": {
        "light": ":root,\n.light,\n[data-a63-mode='light']",
        "dark": ":is(.dark, [data-a63-mode='dark'])"
      }
    }
  }
}
